{"word":"προκάθημαι","uri":"prokathêmai","senses":[{"word":"προκάθημαι","html":"<span class=\"entreea\"><span class=\"grec\">προ·κάθημαι</span></span> (<span class=\"ital\">seul.</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">prés. et impf.</span>) être assis en avant,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où :</span>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">1</span> siéger au premier rang,\n<span class=\"aut\">Pol.</span> <span class=\"refch\">5, 63, 7,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">fig.</span>\noccuper le premier rang (dans une cité, <span class=\"ital\">etc.</span>) être le chef de, <span class=\"ital\">gén.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Plat.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Leg.</span>\n<span class=\"refpa\">758</span><span class=\"refpb\">d</span> ;\n<span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Pol.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">6, 8, 17</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">2</span> être situé en avant de,\n<span class=\"ital\">en parl. d’une île, d’une ville,</span>\n<span class=\"ital\">etc. ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">avec</span>\n<span class=\"grec\">πρό</span> <span class=\"ital\">et le gén.</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"refch\">7, 172 ;</span>\n<span class=\"aut\">Arstt.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">H.A.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">5, 18, 9</span> ||</div>\n<div class=\"pp\"><span class=\"ppa\">3</span> se placer au devant de,\n<span class=\"ital\">d’où</span> veiller à la garde de, <span class=\"ital\">gén.</span> <span class=\"ital\">en parl. de\nsentinelles,</span> <span class=\"aut\">Eur.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Rhes.</span> <span class=\"refch\">6 ;</span> <span class=\"ital\">p. suite :</span> à la défense de, protéger, défendre,\n<span class=\"ital\">gén.</span> <span class=\"aut\">Hdt.</span>\n<span class=\"refch\">8, 36 ;</span> <span class=\"refch\">9,\n106 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Thc.</span> <span class=\"refch\">8,\n76 ;</span> <span class=\"aut\">Xén.</span> <span class=\"oeuv\">Hell.<